CHAPTER 2: CHARACTERISTICS OF THE POPULATION
2.1 Socio-cultural characteristics of the population.
2.1.1 Nationality of the population of Gakenke district .
The results of 5 th RPHC-2022 indicate that, the Rwandan population by nationality
represent 99.11% and foreigners represent 0.89%. In the Northern Province, foreigners
represent 0.11% and Gakenke district, the Rwandan by nationality represent 99.97% and
foreigners represent 0.03% .  Three sectors of Ga kenke districts that have the highest
percentage of foreigners compared to others; those are Nemba (0.07%), Rushashi (0.07%)
and Gakenke (0.07%). The table below illustrates the distribution of the population by
nationality with their respective sectors of residence.
